  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Government of Morocco in Ensuring AVRR for Migrants in a Vulnerable Situation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to improving the migration management system through migrants&apos; protection and assistance. It will reach this objective by offering the alternative of assisted voluntary return and reintegration to an estimate number of 275 migrants in vulnerable situations in Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
